1
00:00:00,334 --> 00:00:03,924
(Sheldon:)...and humiliate me
in front of the whole university.

2
00:00:05,256 --> 00:00:08,096
(Sheldon:)That, FYI, was sarcasm.

3
00:00:09,427 --> 00:00:12,177
(Sheldon:)I, in fact, believe it is a big deal.

4
00:00:14,182 --> 00:00:16,762
-Oh. That poor thing.
-Yeah, I feel terrible.

5
00:00:16,934 --> 00:00:19,974
(Penny:)Wait.
Aren't you gonna go talk to him?

6
00:00:20,146 --> 00:00:23,236
Well, I-- He'll be fine.
The guy's a trouper. Come here.

7
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:27,239
No, no, you're right.
You shouldn't talk to him. I will.

8
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,450
(Leonard:)Man, I cannot catch a break.

9
00:00:36,412 --> 00:00:37,742
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

10
00:00:38,956 --> 00:00:43,166
-Hey. Do you wanna talk?
-About what?

11
00:00:43,336 --> 00:00:45,166
(Sheldon:)Being betrayed by my friends?

12
00:00:45,338 --> 00:00:48,588
(Sheldon:)Spending three months at the North Pole
for nothing?

13
00:00:49,967 --> 00:00:51,637
(Sheldon:)And I didn't even get to go
to Comic-Con.

14
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:52,842
[SOBBING]

15
00:00:55,473 --> 00:01:03,023
(Penny:)Oh, hon--

